The Vim-R-plugin uses the clipboard on Windows, but not on Linux or Mac. On Windows, it sets the clipboard, paste its contents into R Console and, then, restores the clipboard data to the previous value. Please, see: http://www.lepem.ufc.br/jaa/vimrcom.pdf

